  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Inclusive Health
Markets work 2023-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PharmAccess aims to improve access to better healthcare in Sub- Saharan Africa through digitization and blended financing models. PharmAccess uses an integrated approach, focused on strengthening both the demand and supply-side of the health system, as well as capitalizing on the potential of digital innovations, mobile technology for health financing, investments and public-private partnerships. Through our activities in (digital) lending, health insurance, quality improvement, supply chain management, impact research and advocacy, we aim to build trust throughout the healthcare system.</narrative>
  </description>
